# Mirrors the thin-oxide list cell for cell (sg13g2_stdcell's own
# pnr_exclude.cells names lgcp_1, sighold, slgcp_1, sdfbbp_1, dfrbp_2).
#
# All five now carry Liberty entries, so unlike earlier revisions of this
# library they *could* be selected -- which is exactly why they are listed:
#   * the two integrated clock gates are instantiated deliberately, not
#     inferred; enabling clock gating is a design-level decision (set
#     SYNTH_CLOCKGATE_MIN_WIDTH and SYNTH_CLOCKGATE_POSEDGE_ICG
#     "sg13g2_hv_lgcp_1/GATE/CLK/GCLK", and drop lgcp_1 from this list).
#     Yosys takes the ICG from that variable, not from the Liberty.
#   * sighold is a bus holder, placed by hand where a net must not float.
#   * sdfbbp_1's next_state is a scan mux, which dfflibmap cannot
#     pattern-match (see sdfbbp_map.v for the opt-in all-scan flow).
#   * dfrbp_2 is excluded as in the thin-oxide library.
sg13g2_hv_lgcp_1
sg13g2_hv_sighold
sg13g2_hv_slgcp_1
sg13g2_hv_sdfbbp_1
sg13g2_hv_dfrbp_2
